# The gate baseline — single source of truth.
#
# Sourced by verify.sh and preflight.sh. Checked against every document that
# quotes it by check-baseline.sh, which runs as part of verify.sh.
#
# ⚠️ Do NOT inline these numbers anywhere else — not in a script, not in a
# document. Measured 2026-10-06: FOUR different test counts were live in this
# tree at once (223/15, 137/11, 163/13, 97/6) because each carrier kept its own
# copy and the update instruction named only two of them. See T41.
#
# To change the baseline:
#   1. re-derive with `./node_modules/.bin/vitest run` — never guess
#   2. edit ONLY this file
#   3. run `bash docs/agentic/scripts/check-baseline.sh`
#   4. fix every carrier it flags, then re-run it
#
# A DROP in the test count means a guard was deleted, not that the suite got
# faster. Treat it as a failure until proven otherwise.

BASELINE_TESTS=224
BASELINE_FILES=15
BASELINE_VERIFIED=2026-10-08
